WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.782
The diagnosis dashboard is a good materialized-view example.

00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:07.387
Its grain and measures are stable.

00:00:07.387 --> 00:00:09.532
The summary may be read frequently.

00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:13.337
And leadership can tolerate a documented refresh interval.

00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:21.007
The materialized view becomes a small data product with both a schema contract and a freshness contract.

00:00:21.007 --> 00:00:25.187
Choose the smallest reusable object that matches the need.

00:00:25.187 --> 00:00:33.897
A CTE is local to one query, a view centralizes live logic, and a materialized view persists a snapshot.

00:00:33.897 --> 00:00:39.432
Promote logic into shared objects when it is stable, reused, and worth governing as part of the analytical

00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:41.199
architecture.
